## 📂 Repository Structure

```text
├── 📁 manifests/             # Raw YAML Deployment, Service, and Route files
├── 📁 templates/             # OpenShift Templates (.yaml)
├── 📁 src/
│   ├── 🐍 python-flask/      # Source code for Python API
│   ├── 🟢 node-express/      # Source code for Node.js API
│   └── 🐘 php-apache/        # Source code for PHP API
├── 🐳 Dockerfile             # Manual Dockerfile for Quay integration
└── 📄 README.md              # Project documentation
